[
  {
    "id": "a1c0e1f2b3c4d501",
    "type": "comment",
    "name": "Convert a file on this machine to PDF",
    "info": "Reads `/data/report.docx`, converts it to PDF with Converter Studio and writes `/data/report.pdf`.\n\n1. Open the **Converter Studio** config node of the convert node and paste your API key (make one on https://converter.studio/account#api-keys; a free account works).\n2. Change the paths in the **read file** and **write file** nodes to a folder of yours.\n3. Deploy and click the inject node.\n\nThe convert node can take any of 67 formats: change **Convert to** for another one (jpg, png, mp4, mp3…). Errors go to the catch node, with Converter Studio's message in `msg.error.message`.",
    "x": 210,
    "y": 60,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
